<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Nov 19.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Nov 19.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	 112.5/113.5 117.5/118.5 UNQ     230/232</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  118/119   124/125   225/230   241/244</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices were mixed with sellers pulling away offers after crude rebounded strongly and price were expected to rise from earlier levels. The dip in cargo values was also limited by the crude recovery. MDO and gasoil firmed along with current strong cargo prices.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3084)</p>
